  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><p data-end=\"423\" data-start=\"104\"><strong data-end=\"129\" data-start=\"104\">• Brand introduction:</strong><br data-end=\"132\" data-start=\"129\">Ravion® is a California-based tech brand focused on providing high-performance portable power solutions for the Starlink Mini. Designed for outdoor adventurers, remote workers, and off-grid users, Ravion delivers seamless connectivity anywhere with purpose-built, travel-ready battery packs.</p><p data-end=\"720\" data-start=\"425\"><strong data-end=\"451\" data-start=\"425\">• Product description:</strong><br data-end=\"454\" data-start=\"451\">Our flagship product is a 158Wh clip-on battery pack specifically engineered for the Starlink Mini. It offers 6–9 hours of uninterrupted use, IP65 waterproofing, smart power protection, and an ultra-portable design ideal for camping, RVing, aviation, and marine use.</p><p data-end=\"1010\" data-start=\"722\"><strong data-end=\"755\" data-start=\"722\">• USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong><br data-end=\"758\" data-start=\"755\">Ravion is the first and only battery pack designed to <strong data-end=\"852\" data-start=\"812\">securely clip onto the Starlink Mini</strong>, enabling hassle-free mobility without cables or bulk. Lightweight, weather-resistant, and TSA-compliant, it’s the ultimate portable internet power solution.</p><p data-end=\"1182\" data-start=\"1012\"><strong data-end=\"1032\" data-start=\"1012\">• Payment terms:</strong><br data-end=\"1035\" data-start=\"1032\">Affiliates earn <strong data-end=\"1072\" data-start=\"1051\">10–20% commission</strong> per successful referral, paid monthly via PayPal. Custom tiers available for top performers.</p></div>",
